# The `asdconclusions` driver is CUSTOM, so it lives in per-clone git config
# (registered by `asd init`). GitLab's server-side merge has no ASD binary and
# cannot apply it — merges through the UI/API fall back to a plain text merge.
# See DESIGN.md, "The conclusions sidecar is regenerated, not appended".
.asd/conclusions/*.jsonl merge=asdconclusions
